=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4onrqhwPBxrZ9GDVVKmQKUqadmcyscJ7i61yCweVMWUg&oe=6A05CCB7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Thumbnail.png", "id": "792514172662226", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974493_792514175995559_5929871910118818486_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0ctwYkeOc-oQ7kNvwGEUhpE&_nc_oc=AdqGYU2Y5hF9rjXlXxgLChVedBSvNHiiD58PWdcLhLWwmx5femfmddmh4-hndFckCGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5tp0XQq5JKpFGhQLUXZK50iFZbD5a6xaO0E-P5LWWL2g&oe=6A05C976"}, "display_name": "Velocity Rush", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Velocity Rush is tailor-made for players seeking a seamless and user-friendly VR encounter with single input control that makes it effortless to jump right into the action. You'll find yourself swiftly maneuvering through high-speed scenarios, weaving through obstacles, and making split-second decisions that test your reflexes and wits.\n\nKey Features:\n- Simplicity in Action: Experience the thrill with just one input: jump, making the game easy to play for everyone.\n- Motion Sickness-Free: Ensuring a smooth and comfortable experience for all players.\n- Accessible Yet Challenging: Whether you're a casual player or a seasoned expert, Velocity Rush offers enjoyment for all while presenting a rewarding challenge for those seeking mastery.\n- Handcrafted Wonder: Each stage presents new hurdles and complexities, that immerse you in stunning virtual worlds.\n", "short_description": "Dive into the virtual realm of Velocity Rush, a VR platform game that delivers a thrilling experience that is both easy to pick up and intensely challenging. Unleash your inner speedster as you navigate through thrilling levels, all while enjoying a motion sickness-free adventure in the immersive world of Velocity Rush."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.immerscope.com/privacy-policy", "